 kalitorify is a shell script for Kali Linux which use iptables
 settings to create a Transparent Proxy through the Tor Network,
 the program also allows you to perform various checks like checking
 the Tor Exit Node (i.e. your public IP address when you are under
 Tor proxy), or if Tor has been configured correctly checking service
 and network settings.
